          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Range}&=38-(-26)\\\\\\text{Range}&=64\\end{align*}$$\n$-19$ and $15$ each occur twice; every other value occurs once. The modes are $-19$ and $15$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\overline{x}&=\\frac{\\text{sum of data values}}{\\text{number of data values}}\\\\\\overline{x}&=\\frac{\\begin{gathered}-26+(-20)+(-19)+(-19){}+(-13)+(-4)+7+10+15{}+15+20+22+36+38\\end{gathered}}{14}\\\\\\overline{x}&=\\frac{62}{14}\\\\\\overline{x}&\\approx4.43\\end{align*}$$\nIn numerical order, the values are $-26$, $-20$, $-19$, $-19$, $-13$, $-4$, $7$, $10$, $15$, $15$, $20$, $22$, $36$, $38$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Position}&=\\frac{14+1}{2}\\\\\\text{Position}&=7.5\\end{align*}$$\nThe median is between the seventh and eighth values.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Median}&=\\frac{7+10}{2}\\\\\\text{Median}&=8.5\\end{align*}$$",
